From 733ea76c719a86e60c2fd9983fe9b1c7d2d8dcf4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:09:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(ui): original SVG operation icons and the SVG-to-PNG
 icon pipeline

Every OpType now wears its own glyph: 41 original SVG masters under
assets/ui/svg/ (Tabler's conventions - 24-unit grid, 2-unit stroke,
round caps and joins; nothing from HSMWorks, Fusion or SolidCraft),
rasterised to the 32 px PNGs the UI loads by the new `cargo xtask icons`
(resvg =0.45.1, xtask-only; --check compares the committed PNGs with
fresh renders, --sheet draws a 16 px contact sheet on dark and light).

icons.rs becomes one table (enum, ALL, bytes, keys from a macro); the
op-kind mapping moves out of panes.rs into op_icons.rs and drops the old
reuse law. The 18 PNGs no longer used (13 earlier originals, 5 Tabler
stand-ins) are deleted. Pinned by xtask's
committed_icon_pngs_match_their_svg_masters and the lint tests, and the
structural test every_op_kind_has_its_own_svg_mastered_icon.

xtask/ is a process file: PROCESS_VERSION 16 -> 17.
Decision: docs/decisions/661-icon-set.md.

Refs #661

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
