From b908a6a0c09e8a37ac9d16d857fa8ad622a0c844 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:30:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(ui): Face and the groove pair read apart at 16 px;
 PROCESS_VERSION 18

Face is now a plan view (stock with a serpentine raster) instead of a
side view that echoed Facing; Groove Rough shows the plunge comb with the
blade lifted, Groove Finish the bare U finishing path. Main took
PROCESS_VERSION 17 (PR #1117), so this PR takes 18.

Refs #661

